[en.FOCUS_C12_CONTROL_THE_MIRROR_POOL]
Control the Mirror Pool

[en.FOCUS_C12_CONTROL_THE_MIRROR_POOL_desc]
Rumors have long circulated that my sister, Pinkie Pie’s ghost, haunts that place. Regardless of the truth of these rumors, she must have done something there, which brings me a glimmer of hope. No matter who the owner of the Mirror Pool is—be it that damned draconequus or something else—I must obtain it.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONTROL_THE_MIRROR_POOL]
控制镜像水潭

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONTROL_THE_MIRROR_POOL_desc]
坊间一直有传闻那里飘荡着我妹妹萍琪派的幽灵，不论传言是否属实，她肯定曾经在那做过什么，这给我带来一丝希望。不管这个镜像水潭的所有者是那个该死的混沌龙马还是其他什么东西，我都要得到它。

